# OpsForge：构建上下文白名单——镜像只需要二开 app、注册文件与上游构建
# 配置原件，其余（前端源码、验收套件/node_modules、流程文档）一律不进上下文
*
!spug_api
spug_api/*
!spug_api/apps
spug_api/apps/*
!spug_api/apps/ansible_ops
**/__pycache__
!spug_api/pytest.ini
!spug_api/spug
spug_api/spug/*
!spug_api/spug/test_settings.py
!lab
lab/*
!lab/docker
!lab/web-overlay
!docs
docs/*
!docs/docker
